    "Have a Garmin? Track on your phone and send a departure to your wrist. There's an Apple Watch app too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hast du eine Garmin? Verfolge am Handy und sende eine Abfahrt ans Handgelenk. Es gibt auch eine Apple Watch App."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez une Garmin ? Suivez sur le téléphone et envoyez un départ à votre poignet. Il y a aussi une app Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai una Garmin? Segui sul telefono e invia una partenza al polso. C'è anche un'app Apple Watch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It now sits above the gold line and still appears in the list below.": {
      "localizations": {
