          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Portalo al polso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a departure to follow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe auf eine Abfahrt, um ihr zu folgen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez un départ pour le suivre."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tocca una partenza per seguirla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap any connection to track it now. Use its switch to turn the departure reminder off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe auf eine Verbindung, um sie sofort zu verfolgen. Mit dem Schalter stellst du die Abfahrts-Erinnerung ab."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez une correspondance pour la suivre maintenant. Son interrupteur coupe le rappel de départ."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tocca una coincidenza per seguirla subito. Con l'interruttore spegni il promemoria di partenza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of use": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutzungsbedingungen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conditions d'utilisation"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Condizioni d'uso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test distance reminder": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Distanz-Erinnerung testen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester le rappel de distance"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prova promemoria distanza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test reminder": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test-Erinnerung"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rappel test"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Promemoria di prova"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's fine. Your reminder still works, using your last known location instead of live updates. Allow all-time access any time to make it live.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Problem. Deine Erinnerung funktioniert weiter, mit dem letzten bekannten Standort statt Live-Updates. Erlaube den Zugriff jederzeit, um sie live zu machen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun souci. Votre rappel fonctionne toujours, avec votre dernière position connue au lieu du direct. Autorisez l'accès permanent à tout moment pour le rendre live."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Va benissimo. Il promemoria funziona comunque, con l'ultima posizione nota invece degli aggiornamenti live. Concedi l'accesso continuo quando vuoi per renderlo live."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Apple Watch app is included with TrainTime. Install it from the Watch app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Apple Watch App ist bei TrainTime dabei. Installiere sie über die Watch-App."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app Apple Watch est incluse avec TrainTime. Installez-la depuis l'app Watch."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app per Apple Watch è inclusa in TrainTime. Installala dall'app Watch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lead becomes your walk time to the station plus the minutes above. Background updates keep it accurate as you move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Vorlauf wird deine Gehzeit zur Station plus die Minuten oben. Hintergrund-Updates halten ihn genau, während du unterwegs bist."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le délai devient votre temps de marche jusqu'à l'arrêt plus les minutes ci-dessus. Les mises à jour en arrière-plan le gardent précis en déplacement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'anticipo diventa il tuo tempo a piedi fino alla fermata più i minuti sopra. Gli aggiornamenti in background lo tengono preciso mentre ti muovi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The nearest stations and their live departures. Here's Bern Bahnhof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die nächsten Stationen mit ihren Live-Abfahrten. Hier: Bern Bahnhof."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les arrêts les plus proches et leurs départs en direct. Ici : Bern Bahnhof."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fermate più vicine con le loro partenze live. Qui: Bern Bahnhof."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The route to %@ will be forgotten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Route nach %@ wird verworfen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
